{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And he shall bring.</b> Against her will." "<b>Concerning her.</b> With her, or on her account." "<b>Barley meal.</b> Our Rabbis said: she performed an act of a beast, therefore she brings the food of a beast. And the meal-offering of voluntary donation is fine wheat flour, for a memorial, for good. But this meal-offering memorializes sin if it was there; therefore it is deficient in that it is barley, without oil and without frankincense."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:26.462622233Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}